 "description": "Alex Abraham is one of the most influential young voices in modern Amharic literature. His bestselling books have earned wide acclaim for their powerful exploration of love, injustice, and social change, blending Ethiopian tradition with contemporary storytelling. \"ከዕለታት ግማሽ ቀን\" /Ke eletate Gmash Ken/his fifth book, continues this journey—offering a sharp, compelling look at the human experience and the challenges shaping society today.",
